{
  "enabled": true,
  "shapeReasoning": true,

  "policy": {
    "reasoning": {
      "ops": [
        { "op": "extract", "maxChars": 240 }
      ]
    },
    "toolResult": {
      "ops": [
        { "op": "keep" }
      ]
    },
    "toolArgs": {
      "ops": [
        { "op": "keep" }
      ]
    },
    "assistantText": {
      "ops": [
        { "op": "keep" }
      ]
    }
  },

  "cache": {
    "enabled": true,
    "maxBytes": 8388608,
    "maxEntryChars": 16384
  },

  "proxy": {
    "enabled": true,
    "provider": "deepseek-shaped",
    "upstream": "deepseek-official"
  },

  "opTimeoutMs": 8000,
  "lagWarnMs": 2000,
  "stubTemplate": "[reasoning omitted: {chars} chars]",
  "dropUsageOnReplace": true,
  "logStats": true,

  "_注释": [
    "policy 的每一类都是一条 op 链（文本 → 文本）。op 名只表示传输方式：",
    "  exec   = 任何本地命令（python / node / pwsh / 你的 exe），数据格式由 protocol 决定",
    "  http   = 任何 OpenAI 兼容端点（system 是系统提示词，body 可整包覆盖）",
    "  inline = 进程内算法（firstLine / jsonField / regex / code）",
    "  keep/drop/stub/extract/head/tail/truncate = 纯 op（只挑内容，不改结构）",
    "示例（把下面任意一条填进对应类别的 ops 即可）：",
    "  { \"op\": \"exec\", \"command\": \"python\", \"script\": \"D:/shaper/mine.py\" }",
    "  { \"op\": \"http\", \"system\": \"压成 3 行要点，保留路径与数字。\", \"maxTokens\": 200 }",
    "  { \"op\": \"inline\", \"use\": \"code\", \"code\": \"return text.split('\\\\n').slice(-5).join('\\\\n')\" }",
    "完整说明见 README 的「统一协议」一节与 examples/custom-op.md"
  ]
}
